#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:137
msgid ""
"When creating a router, it's helpful to note that the External Network is"
" the floating IP network that has been assigned to the OpenStack project."
" This network will grant your Instances their routes out to the Internet."
" The Internal Subnet can be a layer two subnet that you may have created "
"in the previous step. In addition, multiple subnets can be added to the "
"router (VPC) and the IP address on the subnet would be the router's "
"internal IP address."
msgstr ""

